flowchart LR
    dev[Developer] -- git push --> git[(Git repository)]
    git -. webhook .-> server[API server]
    server --> redis[(Redis)]
    ctrl[Application controller] -- desired manifests --> repo[Repository server]
    repo -- clone, fetch --> git
    repo --> redis
    ctrl -- live state, sync --> kube[Kubernetes API of the target cluster]
    ctrl --> redis
    ui[Web UI, CLI] --> server --> repo
